## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates your ability to manage risk in AI product launches, coordinate across safety, product, and engineering teams, and translate the STAR framework into concrete, measurable steps.

## Key Concepts

- Risk framing and safety controls for AI features
- Cross-functional negotiation and governance
- Measurable safety metrics and phased rollout strategies

## Code Example

```javascript
function isSafeOutput(modelOutput, context) {
  const unsafePatterns = /(bias|harm|abuse|discriminat)/gi;
  const isFlagged = unsafePatterns.test(modelOutput);

  if (isFlagged) {
    logAuditEvent('unsafe_output_blocked', { output: modelOutput, context });
    return { safe: false, reason: 'Pattern detected', fallback: generateSafeFallback(context) };
  }

  return { safe: true, output: modelOutput };
}
```

This example illustrates the core safety pattern: pattern matching, audit logging, and graceful fallback handling.

